  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200C.",
    "Peel and slice 600g potatoes into 5mm rounds.",
    "Toss potatoes, bell pepper, mushrooms, zucchini, and apple with 15ml cider vinegar, 2g turmeric, 1g thyme, 1g pepper and 3g salt.",
    "Spread the mixture in a baking dish.",
    "Drizzle 150ml non‑dairy milk, 200g vegan cheese, and 10ml maple syrup over the vegetables.",
    "Bake uncovered for 30 minutes, until potatoes are tender and the surface is golden.",
    "Remove from oven, stir gently, and reduce heat to 180C.",
    "Return to oven and cook for 10 minutes, until cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Sprinkle 30g chopped walnuts and 15ml coconut oil on top, then bake for 5 minutes until walnuts toast.",
    "Let rest 5 minutes, then serve hot."
  ],
